# pkg/xfce - remote var NAMES (ADR-007): value lives in the caller env or
# ~/.config/cloudify/pkgs/xfce.yaml, never in the repo.
# CLOUDIFY_XFCE_USER: human-given login name (default gui when unset).
# CLOUDIFY_XFCE_USER_PASSWORD: OPTIONAL. When set, used as the GUI user's
# password at user creation (preserved, never printed). When unset, the
# recipe auto-generates one and prints it once. No single quotes or control
# chars in passwords (payload landmine L1).
CLOUDIFY_XFCE_USER
CLOUDIFY_XFCE_USER_PASSWORD
